  "body": "Stale expectation in `crates/cl/tests/headless_bin.rs`: `cl_bin_prints_move_stats` asserted `arcs 30` for `crates/app/tests/golden/contour_disc_hole.cl`, but PR #839 (arc fitting, merged as 575f02d8) regenerated that golden to 33 arcs with the same 69 moves.\n\nVerified on this branch (origin/main 60057449): the test's actual output is `moves: 69 (rapid 12, feed 51, plunge 6, arcs 33)`. Golden records: Arc 33, Rapid 12, Plunge 6, plain Feed 18; feed 51 = 18 + 33 arcs. Only the arc term differed from the expectation. No golden or other file changed.\n\nPinned by: `cl_bin_prints_move_stats` (crates/cl/tests/headless_bin.rs), plus the other two headless_bin tests and the camcraft-cl suites (all green); clippy `-p camcraft-cl --all-targets -D warnings` clean.\nNot exercised: app and ui crates (not built, per the issue scope).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #936\n",
